<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-31T00:55:30.579Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:55:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces dismantled a drug-trafficking network, arresting 31 suspects, while Erbil police detained four suspects in a woman’s murder. Prime Minister Al-Zaidi assumed direct control of the intelligence service and is advancing talks with Damascus on the Sharaa pipeline, border security and oil exports through Baniyas, including a proposal to ship two million barrels per day. Iranian-linked attacks continued, with a Navy corpsman and Marine Raiders rescuing French soldiers from a burning building after an Iranian strike, and a memorial was unveiled in Erbil for victims of the 2024 Iranian missile attack. Chinese missiles have been reported in Iraq, adding a new external dimension. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTFBmVWpMYVhoYmlQYThRX2NBekVoUG5UREZvYXBRejIyMTBHam1QTXE2Q2ZEYWZEcTBxUldJY3V1aUJ4aWFaMmFhRjBfR0VMQV9yV1B0MU5GeU5PaC1SbFB3NkhEYzc1cHQtREtkdWNQdnpBUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Task &amp;amp; Purpose&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxORm5YaHNRM3hGQ1ZWQ2k1ckhKenlVLTRXa3l2U3pYSnF6MGpHNEduYlhrdVJpNGtyYmt0Q2hVVnk0VjVDQUg2M0lyVVFuUFQ2NTZYU1haWTlBWHlnT3BndTN0QjZmUW9EbEhQaGd6SF9uXzBzU1QzaDBMTElKempRMnhxbXdKajY1MkFKSzQ1TUI0R1A5ZGJHS3FCZi1qRFVqVktKWlBBRVFuaXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;MEMRI | Middle East Media Research Institute&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPT25GYlplT0VFYWZXZ0lndTJINHg4R3d3cDJFZTVucE1fY2pNeXRvUko3c2ZYNmcwellIb2dTZmFGYXZtRUotTnFJU1ZtME9yMmlCdGItTV9PRE0xTDl5ejhXTWJNTFE1SXY5TzJfVUk4UG4wY3lhWTdkVlJpVDZRN2hicnh4b3h5d2Q3TzBoN3ZxRExvYjVYVmE3aktlTmRtNkJSSXY0UGVSNGpEakpWdmJfcXRldTV0d3hXN3plcFAyX1RR?oc=5&quot;&gt;FDD's Long War Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE56dWd2Sn